\v 4 \add Now\add* this¦209907 is¦209908 what you need to do¦209910: one third¦209911 of¦209912 you priests¦209915 and¦209916 Levites¦209916 who¦209913 are on duty on the Rest Day must¦209910 guard the \add temple\add* \add ≈entrances\add*.
