\v 6 Don't¦209933 let¦209935 anyone¦209935 enter Yahweh's \add ≈temple\add* other than the priests¦209942 and¦209933 the Levites¦209944 who¦209943 are on duty¦209955, because¦209939 they're consecrated. \add ≈Every one else must¦209946 respect Yahweh's instructions\add* \add not to enter\add*.
\v 7 \add ≈You\add* Levites¦209959 must \add ≈be armed\add* and¦209958 surround¦209958 the \add young\add* king. \add ≈You must kill anyone¦209967 else who¦209967 tries to enter¦209967 the temple, but¦209958 stay close to the king wherever he goes¦209977\add*.
