\v 14 Then Yehoyada¦210133 the priest¦210134 instructed the commanders¦210137, “\add Kill her,\add* but¦210132 not \add here\add* at¦210152 Yahweh's¦210159 temple. \add ≈March her outside¦210147 and¦210149 kill anyone¦210149 who¦210149 sticks up for\add* her.”
