\p
\v 1 Yoash¦210314 was seven¦210312 \add ≈years old\add* when¦210315 he became¦210315 \add Yehudah's\add* king¦210315, and¦210316 he reigned¦210318 from Yerushalem¦210319 for forty¦210316 years. His¦210321 mother¦210321 was Tsivyah¦210322 from Beer¦210323-Sheva.
\v 2 Yoash¦210327 did \add ≈what pleased\add* Yahweh¦210330 \add ≈throughout the lifetime\add* of Yehoyada¦210334 the priest¦210335.
\v 3 Yehoyada¦210340 \add ≈procured\add* two¦210342 wives¦210341 for him, and \add ≈they bore him\add* sons¦210344 and daughters¦210345.
