\v 15 \add ≈By then,\add* Yehoyada¦210604 \add ≈was¦210605 getting old¦210603\add*, and¦210607 he¦210607 died¦210607 \add ≈at¦210613 the age of\add* 130,
\v 16 and they buried¦210615 him¦210615 with¦210616 the kings¦210621 in¦210616 ‘The City¦210616 of David¦210618’, because¦210622 he'd done¦210624 \add so much\add* good¦210625 for Yisrael¦210626, and for God and his¦210629 \add ≈temple\add*.
