\v 1 Then \add King\add* Hizkiyah¦213313 sent¦213312 \add invitations\add* to all¦213316 of¦213316 Yisrael¦213318 and Yehudah¦213319 (including¦213312 Efrayim¦213326 and Menashsheh¦213327) to come¦213328 to Yahweh's¦213331 \add temple\add*,
\v 2 \add ≈because\add* the king¦213340 had¦213339 consulted with¦213345 his¦213341 officials¦213341 and the whole¦213342 assembly¦213344 in Yerushalem¦213345 \add and decided\add* to \add have a late\add* celebration of the Passover¦213347 in \add ≈April\add*.\x + \xo 30:2-3: \xt Num 9:9-11.\x*
\v 3 (They¦213353 couldn't have done it¦213354 at¦213355 the \add proper\add* time¦213355 because¦213357 the priests¦213358 hadn't consecrated¦213361 themselves¦213361 sufficiently¦213363 then, and¦213365 so the people¦213365 hadn't gathered¦213368 in¦213355 Yerushalem¦213370.)
