\v 22 Hizkiyah¦213724 \add ≈sincerely thanked¦213745\add* all¦213728 the Levites¦213730 who¦213731 \add ≈were¦213731 very insightful about¦213727 worshipping\add* Yahweh. Then \add everyone\add* ate¦213736 for¦213735 the prescribed seven¦213740 days¦213741—sacrificing¦213742 peace¦213744 offerings¦213744 and¦213745 confessing to¦213746 Yahweh, their¦213748 ancestors'¦213748 god¦213747.
\s1 The pass-over celebration gets extended
