\p
\v 23 Then the¦213754 \add ≈whole group decided¦213751 to celebrate\add* for seven¦213756 \add more\add* days¦213757, \add ≈so\add* they¦213759 \add ≈enthusiastically\add* celebrated for \add ≈another¦213758 whole week\add*,
\v 24 because¦213765 Yehudah's¦213769 King¦213767 Hizkiyah¦213766 had provided a thousand bulls and seven¦213774 thousand sheep for the people, and the officials¦213778 had also contributed¦213779 another thousand bulls and ten¦213784 thousand sheep. Many \add more\add* priests¦213787 \add also\add* consecrated¦213786 themselves¦213786.
