\v 1 Then¦216677 the people¦216678 of \add ≈Yehudah\add* took¦216677 Yoshiyah's¦216686 son¦216684 Yehoahaz¦216683 and¦216677 made¦216687 him¦216687 king¦216687 in¦216691 Yerushalem¦216691 to replace his¦216690 father¦216690.
