\v 9 Yehoyakin¦216813 was¦216809 eighteen¦216811\f + \fr 36:9 \ft Using 2 Kings 24:8 to (hopefully) correct the Hebrew here which has ‘eight’.\f* when¦216814 he became¦216814 king¦216814, and he reigned¦216819 from Yerushalem¦216820 for \add just\add* ten¦216817 days¦216818. \add ≈He¦216821 did many things that Yahweh¦216824 had said were evil¦216822\add*.
